  "releaseNotes": "9.9.0 · 2026-08-29\n\t\t\t【修复】GetListPageAsync RecordCount 恒为当前页行数（分页前 Count 返回总数）；GetListPageAsync 全链路补 CancellationToken（DAL/IListDAL/IListBLL/BLL 透传）\n\t\t\t【加固】PendingCacheInvalidations 补失效失败静态 ILogger 告警（AddEFCore*Cache 注入，未注册 Logging 降级 Debug）；BaseDAL Dispose/DisposeAsync Interlocked 原子防重入；WebApiBaseBLL.SetDb 类型检查抛语义化异常\n\t\t\t【优化】Db getter XML 文档写全副作用（自动初始化读库 + 写后读绑定消费标志）",
